# A presentation in Russian: Позвольте представить, в заключение
subtitle: "Позвольте представить, как видно из таблицы, можно возразить, в заключение: the frame of a short talk — as Tom rehearses his bank pitch on Masha."
tags: ["russian","presentation in russian","trki 2","arguing in russian","russian phrases"]
teaches: ["writing/presentations","phrases/arguing","vocabulary/business"]
thumb: "band \"Give a talk in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Don't touch! in Russian: aspect in commands","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/207-russian-dont-touch.cast"}

